n: 3.12.3.3
name: template-bounds-never-enforced
kind: observation
is: Template parameter bounds are enforced in neither era. The 2000 compiler stores the bound and resolves an argument to itself or the default without consulting it, at a line marked 'TODO: get type from template'. The 2026 grammar keeps template parameter names only, skipping the one word Object, and instantiation checks the arguments only by count.
