limit: The study did not read every caller of the 2000 resolution routine, so that bounds were syntax only in 2000 is an inference. The 2000 compiler source lies in an archive on local disk outside the repositories. The 2026 support-list row template-kind-constraints is about which kinds of definition a template may wrap (2.20.7#32-33, 2.20.4#543), not about bounds.
at: 2026-11-24
