n: 3.12.4.1
name: logs-2000-pair-executed
kind: observation
is: Six instruction-count logs of the 2000 machine each show interface casts executed 426 to 1,909 times per run, interface-forwarded calls 92 to 2,322, self calls 610 to 2,814 and super calls 44 to 281. A cast cost 0.095 to 0.303 ms per execution and a plain call 0.018 to 0.026 ms; casts took 4.1 to 20.3 percent of instruction time.
status: observed
src: 2.20.1#334 2.20.1#492-497
